1
00:02:02,304 --> 00:02:05,679
呃 我们确定要这么做吗?
Uhh... Are we sure we should do this?

2
00:02:05,846 --> 00:02:08,138
红国王帮了爱丽克丝
Well, the Red King helped Alyx.

3
00:02:08,263 --> 00:02:09,763
我们不是爱丽克丝
We aren't Alyx.

4
00:02:43,471 --> 00:02:45,138
你就是红国王?
You're the Red King?

5
00:02:47,263 --> 00:02:50,721
大胆! 这里没有什么国王!
How dare you! There is no King!

6
00:02:50,763 --> 00:02:53,471
我是红王子
I am the Red Prince.

7
00:02:54,554 --> 00:02:56,138
难!以!置!信!
Why! I! Never!

8
00:02:56,428 --> 00:02:59,428
到了别人的城堡来却连人家是谁都不知道
Coming to someone's castle without even knowing who they are.

9
00:02:59,678 --> 00:03:02,138
而且还是在我生日这天!
And ON MY BIRTHDAY!

10
00:03:02,178 --> 00:03:04,138
生日快乐 殿下!
Happy birthday, Your Majesty!

11
00:03:07,138 --> 00:03:08,763
啊 呃 生日快乐 殿下!
Ah uh, happy birthday Your Majesty!

12
00:03:11,971 --> 00:03:15,638
行了 今天是个好日子 非常感谢
Yes, it's a joyous occasion. Thank you very much.

13
00:03:15,678 --> 00:03:17,221
红王子?
Red Prince?

14
00:03:17,263 --> 00:03:19,721
红国王没有这么无礼
The King wasn't nearly as rude.

15
00:03:20,013 --> 00:03:21,263
也没这么小
Or small.

16
00:03:21,804 --> 00:03:22,596
也没这么吵
Or loud.

17
00:03:22,638 --> 00:03:26,846
如果不是因为你们这个种族 国王还会在这儿呢!
Well, if it hadn't been for your kind, the King Would still be here!

18
00:03:27,678 --> 00:03:28,096
咳咳
Ahem.

19
00:03:31,221 --> 00:03:33,096
生日快乐 殿下
Happy birthday, Your Majesty.

20
00:03:33,596 --> 00:03:35,054
生日快乐!
Happy birthday!

21
00:03:33,928 --> 00:03:36,096
行吧 生日快乐
Happy birthday, I guess.

22
00:03:37,721 --> 00:03:41,178
你们是怎么知道这么机密的情报的?!
How do you know such privileged information?!

23
00:03:41,346 --> 00:03:46,263
你们一定是想偷走我王冠的卧底吧!
You must be infiltrators here to steal my crown!

24
00:03:47,513 --> 00:03:49,638
你自己刚跟我们说的
You LITERALLY just told us.

25
00:03:49,721 --> 00:03:52,846
而且到处都能看到你生日派对的宣传
Also, we säw advertisements for your party! Everywhere.

26
00:03:52,888 --> 00:03:56,846
肃静! 你们面前的可是皇族!
Silence! You are in the presence of royalty!

27
00:03:56,888 --> 00:03:59,096
那就是我 谢谢
And that's me, thank you very much.

28
00:03:59,138 --> 00:04:01,888
猩红城堡的继承人!
The heir to the Crimson Castle!

29
00:04:01,928 --> 00:04:04,763
臆呃...
Eww...

30
00:04:04,928 --> 00:04:08,013
我以前也这么浮夸吗?
Did I use to be this unbearably pompous?

31
00:04:08,596 --> 00:04:10,096
殿下!
Your Majesty!

32
00:04:10,138 --> 00:04:12,428
我们为您带来了一份了不得的礼物!
We have brought you a magnificent gift!

33
00:04:12,471 --> 00:04:14,763
绝对配得上皇室生日
Befitting of the royal birthday.

34
00:04:14,804 --> 00:04:18,513
它非常珍贵! 是曾存在于世上最伟大的战士的武器!
It is very rare! The weapon of the greatest warrior to ever live!

35
00:04:18,554 --> 00:04:20,596
是我们寻来的 只有我们 没有任何其他人的帮助
Acquired by us, and only us, with no help at all.

36
00:04:20,638 --> 00:04:23,388
明明是我们给你的一 啊!
But we're the ones who gave it to you - OWW!

37
00:04:23,596 --> 00:04:24,513
没有任何其他人的帮助
No help at all.

38
00:04:35,304 --> 00:04:40,513
绿的?为什么是绿的?!
Green? WHY IS IT GREEN?!

39
00:04:46,429 --> 00:04:48,220
你怎么可以..
How could you...

40
00:04:48,638 --> 00:04:52,470
殿下 请您原谅我们! 求求您原谅我们 我们不知道是绿的 我们 呃啊啊啊
Forgive us, Your Majesty! Please forgive us... we didn't know it was green... we uh....

41
00:04:54,054 --> 00:04:55,138
把他们带走
Take them away.

42
00:04:56,304 --> 00:04:58,804
求求您了! 殿下! 饶命啊!
Please! Your Majesty! Please!

43
00:04:58,846 --> 00:05:04,929
等等! 是她们给我们的! 是她们的错 饶命啊!
Wait! They gave it to us! It was their fault... Please!

44
00:05:10,596 --> 00:05:13,846
等等! 或许我们可以让您开心起来
Wait! Maybe we can help cheer you up.

45
00:05:15,304 --> 00:05:21,763
嗯哼 砍别人的头却是让我很开心了不过你说说看
Hmm... Beheading people does cheer me up, but... Go on.

46
00:05:22,763 --> 00:05:25,388
我们听说您喜欢玩游戏
We heard you like to play games.

47
00:05:55,804 --> 00:06:00,304
所以 你们跟我玩游戏 是想从我这得到什么呢?
So, what exactly do you desire from me in exchange for playing my game?

48
00:06:00,763 --> 00:06:02,596
游戏从来都不单纯
There's always a catch.

49
00:06:02,929 --> 00:06:07,513
殿下 您的智慧可真是跟您一样 呃
Your Majesty, you are as wise as you are... uh.

50
00:06:09,346 --> 00:06:10,179
一样小!
Small!

51
00:06:12,763 --> 00:06:14,304
谢谢!
Thank you!

52
00:06:14,638 --> 00:06:15,429
很好!
Yes!

53
00:06:15,804 --> 00:06:22,220
如果我们赢了 我们唯一的要求就是请您帮我们到达那棵树的所在
If we win, our only request is that you help us get to the tree.

54
00:06:23,554 --> 00:06:24,888
那棵树?
The tree?

55
00:06:25,304 --> 00:06:27,888
那地方 很远啊
It's so far away.

56
00:06:28,304 --> 00:06:31,304
是啊 所以我们才请求您的
That's... uh... why we're asking.

57
00:06:32,138 --> 00:06:36,596
哼哼
Hmm...

58
00:06:37,138 --> 00:06:41,679
如果你赢了我就帮帮你吧
If you win, I will help you with what you ask.

59
00:06:41,804 --> 00:06:43,679
啊 好的
Ah, great.

60
00:06:44,054 --> 00:06:47,013
那么 呃 我们怎么玩?
So, uh... how do we play?

61
00:06:55,929 --> 00:06:56,804
规则一!
Rule one!

62
00:06:58,929 --> 00:07:03,304
每位玩家在每一回合都可以将每颗棋子移动一步
Each player may move every pawn one space each turn.

63
00:07:03,846 --> 00:07:04,596
规则二!
Rule two!

64
00:07:06,846 --> 00:07:11,096
让更多棋子到达棋盘对面的玩家获胜
Whoever gets the most pawns to the other side of the board, wins.

65
00:07:11,346 --> 00:07:12,263
规则三!
Rule three!

66
00:07:13,804 --> 00:07:19,679
想占领某一格 你必须要清除掉原本在那一格里的人
To take over a space, you must dispose of whoever occupies it.

67
00:07:20,346 --> 00:07:21,929
清除?
Dispose of?

68
00:07:35,013 --> 00:07:40,720
好吧?呃 我好像缺了几颗棋子
Okay? Umm... I think I'm missing some pieces.

69
00:07:42,179 --> 00:07:48,804
嗯 还好你带了朋友一起来玩 不是吗
Hmm.. How perfect that you brought along friends to play, then

70
00:07:56,013 --> 00:07:57,846
呃 啊!
Uh Ah!

71
00:07:57,888 --> 00:07:58,346
啊啊啊!
Ahh!

72
00:07:58,388 --> 00:08:00,304
哈?呃啊啊!
Huh? Ugh Ahh!

73
00:08:00,470 --> 00:08:02,096
你在做什么!?
Okay! What are you doing!?

74
00:08:02,138 --> 00:08:04,179
Weiss?Yang? Blake?
Weiss? Yang? Blake?

75
00:08:04,221 --> 00:08:05,638
现在我们都是小小的了
Now we're all littles.

76
00:08:05,804 --> 00:08:05,846
我们没事
We're okay! AL

77
00:08:06,763 --> 00:08:10,513
Ruby! 现在最重要的就是赢下这局游戏!
Ruby! The most important thing is winning this game!

78
00:08:10,554 --> 00:08:12,138
她们什么情况?
What's wrong with them?

79
00:08:12,179 --> 00:08:14,138
不知道 他们看起来很蠢
I don't know, they look stupid.

80
00:08:15,888 --> 00:08:17,763
我想这些就是我们的队友了
I guess these are our teammates.

81
00:08:19,388 --> 00:08:23,013
不会有人受伤的 对吧?
No one's going to get hurt, right?

82
00:08:25,679 --> 00:08:31,429
既然我是介明君 就让白子先走吧
As I am a gracious ruler, the white team may go first.

83
00:08:31,679 --> 00:08:33,678
开始!
BEGIN!

84
00:08:55,388 --> 00:08:59,220
呃 可以请你往前一步吗?
Uh... Can you advance one space forward, please?

85
00:09:13,346 --> 00:09:16,762
哈哈哈! 我胜了一回!
Hahaha!A victory for me!

86
00:09:26,429 --> 00:09:29,054
好吧 那你们三个向前
Okay. How about you three.

87
00:09:35,054 --> 00:09:36,138
噢...
Oh...

88
00:09:37,178 --> 00:09:40,262
Weiss 你觉得你能占掉那一格吗?
Weiss, do you think you can take that space?

89
00:09:41,554 --> 00:09:43,012
有信心一些
Have some faith.

90
00:09:48,638 --> 00:09:49,678
好耶! Weiss!
Go! Weiss!

91
00:09:55,096 --> 00:09:58,804
新手的运气罢了 我才不怕
Beginner's luck. Doesn't bother me.

92
00:10:01,638 --> 00:10:07,638
跟我说说吧 你们为什么要去树那边?
So, tell me, why do you want to go to the tree?

93
00:10:09,220 --> 00:10:10,638
我们想回家
We want to go home.

94
00:10:11,262 --> 00:10:13,888
我们相信那棵树能带我们回去
And we believe the tree can get us there.

95
00:10:14,388 --> 00:10:15,846
Yang 你上吧
Yang, you're up.

96
00:10:16,304 --> 00:10:17,262
没有问题
All over it.

97
00:10:27,262 --> 00:10:28,262
这些人到底是谁啊?
Who are these people?

98
00:10:28,304 --> 00:10:29,262
真厉害!
Incredible!

99
00:10:34,012 --> 00:10:36,888
那你是怎么知道这事的?
And how do you know this?

100
00:10:37,428 --> 00:10:39,720
我们知道的一个人就是这么回去的
Well, it worked for someone we know.

101
00:10:39,762 --> 00:10:42,388
呃 Blake 到你了
Uh, Blake, your turn.

102
00:10:52,846 --> 00:10:53,512
耶!
Yeah!

103
00:10:58,178 --> 00:11:01,512
你们知道的人吗?
Some one you know, hmm?

104
00:11:02,470 --> 00:11:03,762
喂喂 我们呢?
Hey! Hey! What about us?

105
00:11:03,929 --> 00:11:05,262
需要我们做什么?
What do you want us to do?

106
00:11:09,512 --> 00:11:13,096
够了! 轮到我了!
Enough! It's my turn!

107
00:11:13,304 --> 00:11:17,054
攻击! 全员出击!
Attack! Full steam ahead!

108
00:11:25,096 --> 00:11:26,138
不要!
No!

109
00:11:26,388 --> 00:11:30,054
不应该是这样的!
This is not how it's supposed to go!

110
00:11:30,096 --> 00:11:31,679
这不对!
This isn't right!

111
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:35,928
这不公平!
This isn't fair!

112
00:11:36,138 --> 00:11:36,720
你
You..

113
00:11:37,470 --> 00:11:38,428
你!
You..

114
00:11:40,928 --> 00:11:41,554
等等
Wait.

115
00:11:42,178 --> 00:11:45,470
你说你们是什么生物?
What type of creatures did you say you are again?

116
00:11:46,220 --> 00:11:49,846
呃 Blake是弗纳人
Well, uh... Blake is a Faunus.

117
00:11:50,470 --> 00:11:53,178
Little是一只老鼠 至少我想他应该是吧
Little's a mouse. At least I think.

118
00:11:53,512 --> 00:11:54,096
是呀!
Sure!

119
00:11:54,678 --> 00:11:56,846
然后剩下的我们几个都是人类
And And the rest of us are human.

120
00:12:08,220 --> 00:12:09,304
人类?
Human?

121
00:12:10,054 --> 00:12:11,596
人类!?
Human!?

122
00:12:11,638 --> 00:12:15,429
我就知道! 你们一定作弊了!
I knew it! You must have cheated!

123
00:12:15,679 --> 00:12:18,179
所有士兵! 给我抓住她们!
All of you! Get them!

124
00:12:18,388 --> 00:12:19,846
抓住她们!
Get them!

125
00:13:00,012 --> 00:13:01,804
喂! 放过她们!
Hey! Leave them alone!

126
00:13:01,846 --> 00:13:03,804
你会伤到她们的!
You're going to hurt them!

127
00:13:03,888 --> 00:13:05,804
今天是我的皇家生日!
It's my royal birthday!

128
00:13:05,846 --> 00:13:08,429
我想怎么做都行!
And I can do whatever I like!

129
00:13:31,804 --> 00:13:33,096
我赢了!
I've won!

130
00:13:34,678 --> 00:13:36,054
放弃吧
Give up already.

131
00:13:38,846 --> 00:13:40,638
我们不会的
We won't.

132
00:13:41,804 --> 00:13:44,054
揍飞这群木头人!
Kick their wooden butts!

133
00:14:24,679 --> 00:14:29,012
如果你不投降的话 我就把你们头都砍下来!
If you won't concede, then I will have you beheaded!

134
00:14:29,138 --> 00:14:32,804
随便你怎么闹 但我们就是赢了!
You can throw a tantrum if you want, but we won!

135
00:14:33,012 --> 00:14:34,804
带我们去找那棵树!
The us to the tree!

136
00:14:35,012 --> 00:14:40,096
护卫! 砍她们的头!
Guards! Their heads!

137
00:14:38,638 --> 00:14:40,304
殿下
Your Majesty.

138
00:14:42,554 --> 00:14:45,304
您一定非常的烦躁吧
You must be so distraught.

139
00:14:47,346 --> 00:14:50,970
无法做好您在这一亩地上唯一要做的事情
Unable to do the one thing you were put on this Acre to do.

140
00:14:51,388 --> 00:14:52,596
我明白的
I understand.

141
00:14:53,638 --> 00:14:56,178
但您也绝不想要砍掉她们的头
Surely you don't want to behead them.

142
00:14:56,678 --> 00:14:59,346
她们没有了头会非常脆弱的
They are but fragile things without a head.

143
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:03,804
如果您太生气把她们弄坏了 她们可能就再也回不来了
If you get angry and break them, they might not ever come back.

144
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:08,388
但是 呃啊啊 今天是我的生日!
But... uh.. It's my birthday!

145
00:15:08,429 --> 00:15:10,554
她们都不让我 一
And they wouldn't let me -

146
00:15:09,970 --> 00:15:11,638
我知道的 殿下
I know, Your Majesty.

147
00:15:11,804 --> 00:15:13,470
这真是非常不公平
It truly isn't fair.

148
00:15:14,054 --> 00:15:17,220
您要不计代价地赢下您的游戏
You must play your game and win at any cost.

149
00:15:17,596 --> 00:15:19,138
这一定让您非常伤心
It must hurt your heart.

150
00:15:19,888 --> 00:15:21,429
让我帮您
Let me help.

151
00:15:23,554 --> 00:15:24,179
行吧!
Fine!

152
00:15:24,762 --> 00:15:27,220
我不砍她们头了
I won't behead them.

153
00:15:28,470 --> 00:15:31,179
但是我再也不想见到她们了!
But I never want to see them again!

154
00:15:37,304 --> 00:15:38,970
殿下!
Your Majesty!

155
00:15:39,012 --> 00:15:40,388
我的朋友们怎么办!
What about my friends!

156
00:15:40,428 --> 00:15:43,178
她们还是小小的 而且他说他会 一
They're still tiny. And he promised he would —

157
00:15:42,596 --> 00:15:44,346
承诺就像小鸟一样
Promises are like birds.

158
00:15:44,512 --> 00:15:47,846
它们非常美味 但总是会跑掉
They taste great, but always escape.

159
00:15:48,512 --> 00:15:51,596
你们该走了 趁他还没改变想法
You should go, before he changes his mind.

160
00:15:52,846 --> 00:15:54,262
别碰我!
Don't touch me!

161
00:15:54,470 --> 00:15:56,012
过来 快!
Come, quickly!

162
00:15:56,178 --> 00:15:58,428
你们被放逐了!
You are banished!

163
00:15:58,470 --> 00:15:59,470
放逐!
Banished!

164
00:15:59,512 --> 00:16:01,220
为了殿下!
For His Majesty!

165
00:16:01,888 --> 00:16:02,638
快!
Come on!

166
00:16:05,388 --> 00:16:06,804
我看到她们了!
I see them!

167
00:16:07,054 --> 00:16:08,054
抓住她们!
Get them!

168
00:16:12,846 --> 00:16:14,179
走走走!
Go go go go!

169
00:16:15,346 --> 00:16:17,388
这边 这是出去的路
Here, this is the way out.

170
00:16:17,054 --> 00:16:18,429
她们一定在附近
They must be somewhere.

171
00:16:20,429 --> 00:16:21,846
继续找!
Keep searching!

172
00:16:26,054 --> 00:16:29,138
我不知道到底是哪一步错了
I don't know how that went so wrong.

173
00:16:30,138 --> 00:16:32,762
但谢谢你救了我们
But thank you for saving us.

174
00:16:33,929 --> 00:16:36,846
幸好我那时来王子的宴会看了看
Good thing I dropped by the prince's party when I did.

175
00:16:37,012 --> 00:16:38,638
我一般可不喜欢参加宴会
I usually hate parties.

176
00:16:39,346 --> 00:16:42,304
你们到底是怎么被拉进他的游戏里的?
How did you end up in his game, anyway?

177
00:16:42,928 --> 00:16:44,928
我们想跟红国王讲话
We wanted to speak to/the Red King.

178
00:16:45,346 --> 00:16:47,138
但他不在
But he wasn't there.

179
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:49,970
现在我们又回到原点了
And, now we're back where we started.

180
00:16:50,012 --> 00:16:52,720
国王?你们怎么会知道他的?
The King? How did you know him?

181
00:16:56,054 --> 00:16:58,262
哎呀 时代会改变的 你知道吗
Well, times change, you know.

182
00:16:58,470 --> 00:17:01,054
就像我们一样 当时间到了 我们也会变
And so do we when it's our time to change.

183
00:17:01,888 --> 00:17:03,220
不是吗?
Don't you?

184
00:17:14,221 --> 00:17:15,221
听到了吗?
Did you hear that?

185
00:17:15,596 --> 00:17:17,304
这里曾经是有红国王的
There was a Red King.

186
00:17:18,138 --> 00:17:18,762
是啊
Right.

187
00:17:19,512 --> 00:17:22,096
但是有些事物改变了
But something's changed since then.

188
00:17:22,262 --> 00:17:25,388
很好!所以我们不是在那本破书里
Great! So we are not in the stupid story after all.

189
00:17:25,554 --> 00:17:27,012
我们是在它的垃圾续集里面
We are in its stupid sequel.

190
00:17:29,471 --> 00:17:31,096
首先
First things first.

191
00:17:31,262 --> 00:17:37,888
你是什么?你想要跟国王说什么?还有 你最喜欢的点心是什么?
What are you? What did you need to talk to the King about? And, What is your lavorite dessert?

192
00:17:38,388 --> 00:17:40,471
怎么又来?都说了我们是人类
What, again? We're humans.

193
00:17:40,512 --> 00:17:44,512
呃 不是我说 跟我之前遇过的人相比你真的很无趣
Ugh I must say, you're not nearly as interesting as the others I've met.

194
00:17:44,804 --> 00:17:47,596
那么... 嗯! 等我一下
What about... Uh! Hold that thought.

195
00:17:48,762 --> 00:17:50,178
这猫怎么回事?
What's the deal with this cat?

196
00:17:50,471 --> 00:17:52,512
这里没有一个正常人吗?
Can't anyone here be normal?

197
00:17:53,346 --> 00:17:55,054
那不是一只普通的猫
That's not just any cat.

198
00:17:55,638 --> 00:17:59,138
爱丽克丝迷路时 她遇到了好奇猫
When Alyx was lost, she met the Curious Cat.

199
00:17:59,304 --> 00:18:00,721
好奇猫非常喜欢问问题
Who loved to ask questions.

200
00:18:00,762 --> 00:18:03,096
并且好奇猫帮助爱丽克丝找到了那棵树
And the Curious Cat helped Alyx find the tree.

201
00:18:03,888 --> 00:18:07,054
等等 所以那只猫是我们离开这里的关键?
Wait... So the cat is our ticket out of here?

202
00:18:08,054 --> 00:18:10,096
露宝宝! 别让那只猫跑了!
Rubs! Don't let that cat get away!

203
00:18:10,221 --> 00:18:11,554
猫?! 什么猫?
Cat?! What cat?

204
00:18:12,138 --> 00:18:15,554
我的天哪 我就知道我该睡一会儿的
Oh goodness, I know I need a nap.

205
00:18:24,096 --> 00:18:25,428
走 跑
Go. Run.

206
00:18:26,096 --> 00:18:26,762
打破
Break.

207
00:18:32,512 --> 00:18:33,221
修理
Fix.

208
00:18:50,846 --> 00:18:51,721
寻找
Find.

209
00:19:10,012 --> 00:19:11,346
停
Stop.

210
00:19:13,346 --> 00:19:14,262
结束
End.

211
00:19:19,471 --> 00:19:21,138
抵抗
Resist.

212
00:19:22,012 --> 00:19:24,638
不 不
No. No.

213
00:19:24,678 --> 00:19:26,804
不!
No!